---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main>
		<section class="page-hero">
			<img
				src="/images/child-club/membership/hero.jpeg"
				alt=""
				class="page-hero__image"
			/>

			<div class="page-hero__overlay"></div>

			<div class="page-hero__content">
				<h1>滝川学区子ども会入会案内</h1>
			</div>
		</section>

		<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="パンくずリスト">
			<div class="page-inner">
				<a href="/">Home</a>
				<span>/</span>
				<a href="/child_club/">子ども会</a>
				<span>/</span>
				<span>滝川学区子ども会入会案内</span>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<section class="membership-intro">
			<div class="page-inner narrow">
				<h2>滝川学区子ども会への入会について</h2>

				<div class="prose">
					<p>
						滝川学区子ども会は、5つの地域に分けて活動しています。
					</p>

					<ol class="club-list">
						<li>滝川東子ども会</li>
						<li>山里子ども会</li>
						<li>川名山ガーデン子ども会</li>
						<li>川名山子ども会</li>
						<li>八事本町子ども会</li>
					</ol>

					<p>
						居住地域によって所属する子ども会が決まります。
					</p>

					<p>
						滝川学区子ども会への入会は随時受け付けています。
						入会希望の方は、下記のフォームよりお申し込みください。
					</p>

					<p class="application-button-wrap">
						<a
							class="application-button"
							href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf0nRBxTi86UcSkmqw3h7eqfV4_dyXblhX4f61HV7CHn7wWNw/viewform"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							入会申込みフォーム
						</a>
					</p>

					<div class="notice-box">
						<p>
							入会申込みの途中で、画面に表示されるQRコードを読み取る手順があるため、
							スマートフォンではなくパソコンからのお申し込みをおすすめします。
						</p>

						<p>
							保険の関係で、入会月の前月20日まで
							（4月入会については3月31日まで）に
							入会手続きをしていただく必要があります。
						</p>
					</div>

					<p>
						たくさんのご入会をお待ちしております。
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="map-section">
			<div class="page-inner narrow">
				<h2>滝川学区子ども会マップ</h2>

				<img
					src="/images/child-club/membership/map.png"
					alt="滝川学区子ども会の地域区分マップ"
					class="club-map"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
<style>
	.page-inner {
		width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px));
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.narrow {
		max-width: 900px;
	}

	.page-hero {
		position: relative;
		height: 420px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.page-hero__image {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center;
	}

	.page-hero__overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: rgb(0 0 0 / 20%);
	}

	.page-hero__content {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		padding: 24px;
	}

	.page-hero h1 {
		margin: 0;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 60px);
		font-weight: 400;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.breadcrumbs {
		padding: 32px 0;
		background: #fff;
	}

	.breadcrumbs .page-inner {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 8px;
		font-size: 14px;
	}

	.breadcrumbs a,
	.text-link {
		color: #00a6e9;
		text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
	}

	.membership-intro {
		padding: 88px 0;
		background: #f4f9fc;
	}

    .membership-intro h2,
    .map-section h2 {
        margin: 0 0 56px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }

	.membership-intro-records {
		padding: 88px 0;
		background: #fff;
	}

	.intro-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
		gap: 64px;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.intro-image img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.prose {
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 2;
	}

	.prose p {
		margin: 0 0 22px;
	}

	.prose--narrow {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

    .club-list {
        margin: 0 0 28px;
        padding-left: 1.5em;
        line-height: 2;
    }

    .application-button-wrap {
        margin: 36px 0;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .application-button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border: 1px solid #ea7300;
        background: #ea7300;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .application-button:hover {
        background: #fff;
        color: #ea7300;
    }

    .notice-box {
        margin: 40px 0;
        padding: 28px 32px;
        background: #fff;
        border-left: 4px solid #ea7300;
    }

    .notice-box p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .map-section {
        padding: 88px 0;
        background: #fff;
    }

    .club-map {
        display: block;
        width: min(760px, 100%);
        height: auto;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

	.rules ul {
		margin: 0 0 28px;
		padding-left: 1.5em;
	}

	.flyer-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 32px;
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 48px auto 0;
	}

	.flyer {
		display: block;
		padding: 0;
		border: 0;
		background: transparent;
		cursor: zoom-in;
	}

	.flyer img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}
    
    /* 年次記録 */

    .record {
        border-top: 1px solid #d9e0e5;
    }

    .record:last-child {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e0e5;
    }

    .record-toggle {
        display: flex;
        width: 100%;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 24px;
        padding: 28px 0;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: #111827;
        font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);
        font-weight: 500;
        text-align: left;
        cursor: pointer;
    }

    .record-toggle:hover {
        color: #ea7300;
    }

    .record-toggle__icon {
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 300;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .record-toggle[aria-expanded='true'] .record-toggle__icon {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .record-content {
        display: none;
        padding: 16px 0 72px;
    }

    .record-content.is-open {
        display: block;
    }

    .record-section {
        margin-top: 64px;
    }

    .record-summary-section {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 24px auto 0;
    }

    .record-section h3 {
        margin: 0 0 32px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .record-summary {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 2;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .record-details {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 48px auto 0;
    }

    .record-details p {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr;
        column-gap: 16px;
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .record-details strong {
        white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .photo-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .record-photo {
        padding: 0;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        cursor: zoom-in;
    }

    .record-photo img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
        object-fit: cover;
    }

    .flyer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 32px;
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 32px auto 0;
    }

    .flyer {
        display: block;
        padding: 0;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        cursor: zoom-in;
    }

    .flyer img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
    }

	/* lightbox */

	.lightbox {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 3000;
		display: none;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 40px 90px;
		background: rgb(0 0 0 / 88%);
	}

	.lightbox.is-open {
		display: flex;
	}

	.lightbox__content {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		max-width: 100%;
		max-height: 100%;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.lightbox__image {
		display: block;
		max-width: 94%;
		max-height: 86vh;
		width: auto;
		height: auto;
		object-fit: contain;
		cursor: zoom-in;
		user-select: none;
		-webkit-user-drag: none;
		transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1);
		transform-origin: center center;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease;
	}

	.lightbox__image.is-zoomed {
		cursor: grab;
		transition: none;
	}

	.lightbox__image.is-dragging {
		cursor: grabbing;
	}

	.lightbox__close {
		position: absolute;
		top: 20px;
		right: 24px;
		z-index: 2;
		width: 48px;
		height: 48px;
		border: 0;
		background: transparent;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 40px;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.lightbox__nav {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		z-index: 2;
		display: grid;
		width: 56px;
		height: 72px;
		place-items: center;
		border: 0;
		background: rgb(0 0 0 / 25%);
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 56px;
		cursor: pointer;
		transform: translateY(-50%);
	}

	.lightbox__nav--prev {
		left: 20px;
	}

	.lightbox__nav--next {
		right: 20px;
	}

	.lightbox__counter {
		margin: 12px 0 0;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 13px;
	}


    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .photo-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.page-inner {
			width: min(100% - 32px, 1120px);
		}

		.page-hero {
			height: 300px;
		}

		.page-hero h1 {
			font-size: 36px;
		}

        .membership-intro,
        .map-section {
            padding: 64px 0;
        }

        .notice-box {
            padding: 24px;
        }

		.intro-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 36px;
		}

		.flyer-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 24px;
		}

		.lightbox {
			padding: 64px 50px 32px;
		}

		.lightbox__image {
			max-width: 100%;
			max-height: 78vh;
		}

		.lightbox__nav {
			width: 44px;
			height: 60px;
			font-size: 44px;
		}

		.lightbox__nav--prev {
			left: 4px;
		}

		.lightbox__nav--next {
			right: 4px;
		}

        .record-toggle {
            padding: 22px 0;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .record-content {
            padding-bottom: 56px;
        }

        .record-section {
            margin-top: 48px;
        }

        .record-details {
            margin-top: 36px;
        }

        .record-details p {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .record-details strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .photo-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 12px;
        }
	}
</style>